{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 89, "line_no": 35, "text": "他们已掌握的汉字来书写、记录口耳相传的摩经。但由于汉文教育在布依族中尚未兴", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 2317, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "他们已掌握的汉字来书写、记录口耳相传的摩经。但由于汉文教育在布依族中尚未兴", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 2317, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 89, "line_no": 36, "text": "起，故这种情况还比较少。", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 2382, "w": 458, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "起，故这种情况还比较少。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 2382, "w": 458, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
